[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Lift the bonnet lid.</p><p>1. Protect door eges (1a), door sill (1b) and front pillar base\n(1c) by applying adhesive tape.</p><p>2. Undo the nut.</p><p>3. Undo the bolts.</p><p>4. Recover the washers.</p><p>5. Remove the wing.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045357.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check the wing is undamaged.</p><p>Position the wing  and screw in the bolts\nand nut without tightening.</p><p>Check the wing is aligned with the door\nand the bonnet lid.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429478\">7005A14</a></p><p>Tighten the bolts and nut.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT WING. BODYSHELL</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.8</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>FRONT WING. BODYSHELL</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.8</p></td></tr></table></div>"]]